  "id": "nmda",
  "term": "NMDA",
  "definition": "In this review context, NMDA refers to a glutamatergic mechanism implicated in the recall, or efferent, pathways of conditioned immune enhancement. It is described as one of several neurochemical systems that may help learned sensory cues influence immune responses.",
